crates/unlace-idb ports the IDA database readers of idb-rs
(https://github.com/Vector35/idb-rs), released under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
Copyright Rubens Brandao and the idb-rs contributors: the IDB container and its section
compression, the ID0 B-tree and root record, the ID1/IDAS/ID2 flags and NAM. Each ported
file says so in its header.

